# T7b STUDIO 15: motion. Turning K1-K4 on the motion page while a pass records writes motion at
# the playhead step; the first two distinct params claim lane 0 and lane 1, a third stays off with
# "2 lanes max"; the page draws each lane's curve; the lanes play back as the clip engine's motion
# events.
wait 300
cursor 1 0
tap SEQ
tap HOME
tap SEL
tap PLAY
wait-bar 1
expect liveclip1 7
# the editor, then its motion page
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
expect view 14
tap REC
expect recrec 1
wait 200
spin K1 30
wait 250
spin K1 30
wait 250
spin K1 -20
wait 250
spin K2 40
wait 250
spin K2 20
# a third param: no lane, "2 lanes max"
spin K3 40
expect mlparam7.1 >0
tap REC
wait-bar 2
expect recrec 0
expect mlparam7.0 >0
expect mlparam7.1 >0
wait 1400
shot studio_clipmotion.png
dump studio_clipmotion.json
events studio_clipmotion_events.txt
wait-bar 1
eventsstop
